Subject: [PATCH 2/3] P11: execute existing goldens natively and on the real
 VM.

- if_pos join-slot: also run the Stage-1 ELF natively for all 16
  case/input pairs and require Stage-1 ELF == host ELF for every case
  (Stage-1 was compile-only, and only for arith_else_temps).
- while_sum_even: the "VM" leg used AOT-first (= Wasm); use the real VM,
  and run both ELFs natively for limits 10/11/2/1/100.
- pack5_direct_aot: ELF was header-checked only; execute it (2422).
- pack5_trit_vec, decision_hook: add real VM + native x86-64 legs.
- arena_lifecycle: add real VM, native x86-64 and native Stage-1 legs.
Stage-1 pack5/EGATE gaps stay tracked in OMNI_DIFF4_KNOWN_DIVERGENCES.
Selftest 537 -> 556. Frozen hashes unchanged.
